<title>USA: Prime Cellular cuts off Bern unit funds.</title>
<headline>Prime Cellular cuts off Bern unit funds.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Cellular Inc said on Friday it will stop funding the operations of Bern Communications Inc, its wholly owned subsidiary.</p>
<p>Bern developed software and hardware products for Internet providers.  Prime Cellular said in a news release that its decision was based on &quot;numerous factors,&quot; which it did not specify.</p>
<p>Prime Cellular said it will attempt to maximize Bern's existing assets but no longer will fund ongoing development and full operations.</p>
